aths can turn out to be... unpredictable...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/Build_Base.gif?t=1751276122\" /></div><br><br><strong>Harvest Resources</strong><br>To accumelate resources, killing the enemy isn't enough. Players need to roam the map for chests to pick up which contain numerous random rewards. In addition blue crystals are spread around the map which players can harvest for funds.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/Harvest_Resources.gif?t=1751276122\" /></div><br><br><strong>Defend your Base</strong><br>Your base is a lot more than just turrets: you can buy / upgrade weapons, items, and more! <br>Using a combination of weaponry and structures you need to defend your HQ from the enemy hordes until the end!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/Defend_your_base.gif?t=1751276122\" /></div>","developers":["9000 Legends"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/header.jpg?t=1751276122","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 \u2014 9000 Legends. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126610,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126610/movie480.mp4?t=1744789307","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126610/movie_max.mp4?t=1744789307"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126610/0fd8b9592aa524aa0269e5d791eace01da68b95a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744789307","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126610/movie480_